      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done, I have changed it to a string-array where symbolic names for keycode constants can be added, for example \"VOLUME_DOWN\".\n\nAllowing multiple additional wake keys seems like a more generic solution. Sony will probably add all HW keys except the power key so the user can wake up the device on \"any\" key.",
