      "writtenOn": "2024-01-12T13:21:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is the right logic; we don\u0027t want to always wake the device on volume key. Reading the bug description, it sounds like we would like to do that only for the internal keyboard.",
      "revId": "0241d9f067cb73810021182f3da3a9445053a7f9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
